# Gemfile.lock is committed on purpose. This repo is not only a gem — it is
# also the site deployed by .github/workflows/pages.yml, and a deploy that
# resolves dependencies afresh can break with no change of your own. It has no
# effect on anyone installing the theme: they resolve from the .gemspec.
